WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:13.720
Cherophobia is the fear of fun.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:20.500
There are no clocks in Las Vegas gambling
casinos (So you stay longer)

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.029
In ancient Egypt, pillows were made of stone.

00:00:25.029 --> 00:00:30.480
Golf courses cover 4% of North America.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:36.910
Squirrels plant thousands of new trees each
year simply by forgetting where they put their

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:38.700
acorns.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:44.870
The largest snowflake ever recorded reportedly
measured 15 inches across.

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:52.120
Under the reign of Chairman Mao, every Chinese
family was obliged to kill a sparrow a week

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:55.000
to stop them from eating all the rice.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.170
The project was ineffective because sparrows
don't eat rice.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:07.159
It is physically impossible for pigs to look
up into the sky.

00:01:07.159 --> 00:01:12.049
You can tell from the statue of a mounted
horseman how the rider died.

00:01:12.049 --> 00:01:17.960
If all four of the horse's feet are on the
ground, he died of natural causes.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:22.109
One foot raised means he died from wounds
suffered in battle.

00:01:22.109 --> 00:01:26.109
Two legs raised means he died in action.

00:01:26.109 --> 00:01:33.789
Until the 1960s, the only reliable pregnancy
test was to inject a woman's urine into a

00:01:33.789 --> 00:01:35.999
female African clawed frog.

00:01:35.999 --> 00:01:41.950
If the woman was pregnant, the frog would
ovulate within 12 hours.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:45.200
Every day 20 banks are robbed.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:49.350
The average take is $2,500

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:55.840
When you dream everything and everyone you
see in that dream you have seen or met before

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:57.219
in real life.

00:01:57.219 --> 00:01:59.100
Nothing is made up.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:09.330
There are over 1,200 species of bat in the
world and not one of them is blind.

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:15.250
The word 'school' comes from the ancient Greek
for 'free time'.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:21.400
Sending a man to the Moon and finding Osama
Bin Laden cost the US government about the

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:28.430
same amount of time and money: ten years and
$100 billion.

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:34.459
Loch Ness is deep enough and long enough to
contain the entire population of the world

00:02:34.459 --> 00:02:40.219
ten times over.

